<title>THAILAND: Int'l Broadcasting 1996 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Int'l Broadcasting 1996 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited consolidated financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  Loss	5.85	vs  Loss     4.54</p>
<p>    Net	   Loss    427.38	vs  Loss   331.26</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is International Broadcasting Corp Plc, a cable television firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
